   "The 2027 outlook is supported by an expected improvement in real disposable personal income (DPI) growth of +4.2%, driven by falling inflation and cost-of-living adjustments.",
   "Economists forecast two interest rate cuts in 2027 (June and December), which is expected to support higher mortgage equity withdrawals (MEW) and borrowings.",
